[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_4e76ea0753bad011\",\"r_3e85853b11b5bce5\"],null,null,[[\"rc_fd791be36a7542e0\",[\"Expert forecasts and secondary-market benchmarks project SpaceX's valuation to land between **$800 billion and $1.25 trillion** by the end of 2026, moving up from late-2025 insider tender offers that valued the company around $800 billion. \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Valuation Consensus \\u0026 Multiples Summary\\n\\n| Scenario | Implied Valuation Range | Implied Revenue Multiple (FY26E) | Primary Narrative / Baseline |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Bear Case** | **$550B – $700B** | ~24x – 30x | Regulatory delays on Starship, consumer Starlink churn/saturation, execution friction. |\\n| **Base Consensus** | **$800B – $1.0T** | ~35x – 43x | Continued Starlink enterprise scale ($18B+ run-rate) and launch cadence dominance. |\\n| **Bull / IPO Case** | **$1.25T – $1.5T** | ~50x – 65x | Rapid Direct-to-Cell rollout, Starship operational cadence, and pre-IPO positioning. |\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Key Upside Catalysts\\n\\n* **Starlink Unit Economics \\u0026 Direct-to-Cell Expansion:** Starlink accounts for the bulk of high-margin recurring cash flows. Commercialization of Direct-to-Cell mobile broadband (accelerated via spectrum deals such as EchoStar) substantially expands the Total Addressable Market (TAM) beyond fixed-broadband rural consumers into telecom backhaul and consumer connectivity.\\n* **Starship Full Reusability \\u0026 Payload Cost Compression:** Transitioning Starship from test flights to routine orbital payload delivery lowers launch costs per kilogram by over 80% compared to Falcon 9. This unlocks rapid deployment of larger Starlink V3 satellites and enables higher orbital launch frequency.\\n* **Defense \\u0026 Sovereign Infrastructure Contracts:** Broadened defense procurement through initiatives like Starshield, orbital tracking, and secure communications provides high-margin, multi-billion-dollar backlog stability alongside NASA Artemis milestones.\\n* **Potential Public Offering (IPO) Roadmap:** While timing remains fluid, secondary market pricing continues to build in a liquidity/scarcity premium ahead of an eventual partial or full public listing.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Downside Risks\\n\\n* **Multiple Compression \\u0026 Tech Sentiment:** Valuing SpaceX between 35x and 65x sales places it at a substantial premium compared to traditional aerospace/defense contractors (typically 1.5x–3x) and high-growth software/infrastructure firms (10x–20x). A broader macro contraction or rising cost of capital would pressure private secondary multiples.\\n* **Spectrum Allocation and Regulatory Hurdles:** Direct-to-Cell services and Starlink orbital shell deployments face stringent regulatory scrutiny from the FCC, ITU, and local sovereign regulators, as well as opposition from terrestrial mobile operators.\\n* **Starship Capital Expenditure Drag:** High developmental capex and potential launch anomalies could prolong cash burn before Starship achieves positive operational leverage.\\n* **Key-Person \\u0026 Governance Risk:** Concentrated governance and operational dependence on Elon Musk carry ongoing headline volatility and operational cross-pressures across his broader corporate ecosystem.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### References\\n* [Sacra Research: SpaceX Valuation \\u0026 Multiples](https://sacra.com/c/spacex/valuation/)\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[[[],\"Searched the web\",\"Google Search\",\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg/v6/192px.svg\",[],\"Searched the web\",\"\",[[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://sacra.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://sacra.com/c/spacex/valuation/\",\"SpaceX: $800.00B valuation [2026] - Sacra\",null,[]],[\"https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://satnews.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://satnews.com/2025/12/06/spacex-targets-800-billion-valuation-in-secondary-sale-eyes-2026-ipo/\",\"SpaceX Targets $800 Billion Valuation in Secondary Sale, Eyes\",null,[]],[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.ebc.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.ebc.com/forex/spacex-ipo-in-2026-valuation-date-and-how-to-invest\",\"SpaceX IPO in 2026? Valuation, Date and How to Invest\",null,[]],[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://marketwise.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://marketwise.com/investing/spacex-ipo-this-rocket-company-aims-for-one-of-the-largest-ipos-ever/\",\"SpaceX IPO: Elon Musk Targets a $1.5 Trillion Valuation - MarketWise\",null,[]],[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.markets.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.markets.com/analysis/spacex-stock-price-prediction\",\"SpaceX Stock Price Prediction 2026, 2027, 2030 \\u0026 2040\",null,[]],[\"https://t0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.coinbase.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.coinbase.com/price-prediction/solana-spacex-prestocks-sfth\",\"SpaceX PreStocks (SPACEX) Price Prediction [2026, 2027, 2030\",null,[]],[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://futuresearch.ai/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://futuresearch.ai/spacex-ipo-valuation/\",\"SpaceX IPO Price and Stock Forecast to 2027 - FutureSearch.ai\",null,[]]]]]]]],[\"New York, USA\",\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\",false,null,\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\u003dAvIzW62PGhAfUQRpZ9e4q2af_7_WOsFiVpXkQpd9LX0zB0dpJdp9NdkGa-o9tBoMCvd_Di6NgmlfyQXVg4MjqFFJU5C9KoCTOCJ6dgPFDBPpFVbqYZh0Zc64U3skCrf4jwF8niK7flGYwqgOmji5U7TBRwp7BHZh3ps424DbYR5MR0cpmx2J9OED3SQgECsR\"],null,null,\"US\",null,null,null,null,null,false,null,null,null,null,\"en\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,true,true],[false,true,false,false,true,false],false,[[[\"Academic - Other\",0.0028292292],[\"Coding\",0.0040703774],[\"Creative - Other\",4.7371455E-4],[\"Creative Writing\",0.015533173],[\"Customer Support\",7.58186E-5],[\"Daily Life Expert - Other\",0.0017294406],[\"Daily Life Personal - Other\",2.0930714E-4],[\"Data Analysis\",0.13944186],[\"Emotional Support\",3.5163332E-4],[\"Engagement - Other\",0.018058404],[\"Events\",6.6382396E-5],[\"Finance / Accounting\",0.13620028],[\"Fitness\",2.9640834E-4],[\"Games\",6.613983E-4],[\"General Info Seeking\",0.05429618],[\"Government / Law\",5.4361863E-4],[\"HR / Career Management\",0.026421625],[\"Health\",2.1241573E-4],[\"Life Organizer\",0.0010372951],[\"Lifelong Learning\",0.011645396],[\"Marketing \\u0026 Advertising\",0.009250079],[\"Meals / Nutrition\",0.007874128],[\"Media / Entertainment\",0.03776455],[\"Multimodal Generation\",0.0032804094],[\"News / Status\",0.054536104],[\"Personal Finance\",0.17376372],[\"Professional - Other\",0.061538693],[\"Sales / Order Fulfillment\",0.0018919035],[\"School Work\",0.0048620133],[\"Shopping\",0.00577683],[\"Social / Roleplay\",0.020246139],[\"Sports\",0.06043752],[\"Teaching\",2.4685272E-4],[\"Travel\",7.2383316E-4],[\"Troubleshoot Issues\",4.098405E-4]],[[\"Action Execution / Device Control - Other\",4.546556E-4],[\"Advice \\u0026 Opinion - Other\",0.0030004692],[\"Analyze Image Files\",0.00324889],[\"Audio Generation\",2.71647E-5],[\"Brainstorming\",8.779391E-4],[\"Casual Interaction / Chat - Other\",0.02359909